{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/GAME.png?t=1745080498\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallowanderband is an adventure rhythm-action game featuring Halloween-themed stories animated in a cartoon style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Fellowship of the Hallowanderband has been founded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Apprentice Reaper 'Ryoul' arrives in the Halloween town of Hallowonderland to fulfill his duties, but is overwhelmed by a mound of work she has to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At last, she decides to put his work on hold and form a marching band, the Hallowanderband, to fulfill a long-held dream of marching in the Halloween parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join her on her journey of stepping forward to fulfill her dream as you and Ryoul meet various characters and grow together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Happenings in the marching band</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc778\uac8c\uc784_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the animation change according to the input of the left-right circled note track and enjoy the episodes of various characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ta-Da!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc9dc\uc794_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever the story gets intense, a sudden event will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to overcome the 'Ta-Da' events that vary from episode to episode!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What we need is, the background story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\ub300\ud654_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come listen to the stories your characters have to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through dialogues, you'll get to know these fascinating characters and experience their deeper stories.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3127030?t=1745080498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745080498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745080498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745080498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/GAME.png?t=1745080498\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallowanderband is an adventure rhythm-action game featuring Halloween-themed stories animated in a cartoon style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Fellowship of the Hallowanderband has been founded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Apprentice Reaper 'Ryoul' arrives in the Halloween town of Hallowonderland to fulfill his duties, but is overwhelmed by a mound of work she has to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At last, she decides to put his work on hold and form a marching band, the Hallowanderband, to fulfill a long-held dream of marching in the Halloween parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join her on her journey of stepping forward to fulfill her dream as you and Ryoul meet various characters and grow together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Happenings in the marching band</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc778\uac8c\uc784_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the animation change according to the input of the left-right circled note track and enjoy the episodes of various characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ta-Da!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc9dc\uc794_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever the story gets intense, a sudden event will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to overcome the 'Ta-Da' events that vary from episode to episode!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What we need is, the background story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\ub300\ud654_202504.gif?t=1745080498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come listen to the stories your characters have to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through dialogues, you'll get to know these fascinating characters and experience their deeper stories.</p>","developers":["White-Kite"],"genres":[{"des